">I </span><span begin="01:30.403" end="01:30.768">wouldn't </span><span begin="01:30.768" end="01:30.994">see </span><span begin="01:30.994" end="01:31.203">you </span><span begin="01:31.203" end="01:31.635">out </span><span begin="01:31.635" end="01:31.843">at </span><span begin="01:31.843" end="01:32.051">the </span><span begin="01:32.051" end="01:32.988">movies</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.988" end="01:36.995"><span begin="01:32.988" end="01:33.180">What </span><span begin="01:33.180" end="01:33.388">you </span><span begin="01:33.388" end="01:33.853">doing </span><span begin="01:33.853" end="01:34.108">to </span><span begin="01:34.108" end="01:34.494">me </span><span begin="01:34.494" end="01:34.702">you're </span><span begin="01:34.702" end="01:35.049">taking </span><span begin="01:35.049" end="01:35.239">him </span><span begin="01:35.239" end="01:35.415">where </span><span begin="01:35.415" end="01:35.591">we </span><span begin="01:35.591" end="01:35.943">used </span><span begin="01:35.943" end="01:36.151">to </span><span begin="01:36.151" end="01:36.995">go</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.995" end="01:42.409"><span begin="01:36.995" end="01:37.220">Now </span><span begin="01:37.220" end="01:37.460">if </span><span begin="01:37.460" end="01:37.683">you're </span><span begin="01:37.683" end="01:38.116">tryna </span><span begin="01:38.116" end="01:38.533">break </span><span begin="01:38.533" end="01:38.947">my </span><span begin="01:38.947" end="01:39.568">heart </span><span begin="01:39.568" end="01:39.777">it's </span><span begin="01:39.777" end="01:40.522">working </span><span begin="01:40.522" end="01:40.971">because </span><span begin="01:40.971" end="01:41.131">you </span><span begin="01:41.131" end="01:42.185">know </span><span begin="01:42.185" end="01:42.409">that</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.409" end="01:45.785"><span begin="01:42.409" end="01:42.745">That </span><span begin="01:42.745" end="01:43.001">should </span><sp